# mandelbrot in the emulator's window (ECP5_GUI_SCRIPT; see gui/src/trace.rs).
# A frame is about 0.15 s of board time (the UART, not the engine, sets it);
# at ~2.5 MHz in fast mode the window draws one every second or two, and the
# LEDs shimmer with the iteration count of each pixel.
# Buttons are held for a second: the design debounces them for 10 ms
# (250 000 clocks), which the window may take most of a second to run.
# A key or button acts when the frame being drawn ends.
0 rate max
0 run
1 board 3d
4 button 1 down    # FIRE1: zoom in x2
5 button 1 up
10 button 6 down   # RIGHT: pan 1/8 of the width
11 button 6 up
16 button 3 down   # UP: pan up
17 button 3 up
22 button 1 down   # FIRE1: zoom in again
23 button 1 up
28 type t          # the seahorse-valley tour: 8 views
70 quit
